# CLAUDE.md

This file is the **single source of truth** for any coding agent working on
this repository. Read it before writing or modifying any code. It gives the
structural context up front so you do not re-scan the codebase every session,
and it routes you into `.agents/`, where the rules, patterns and plans live.

