## Mandatory reading order

Before any task, read the files relevant to what you are about to do:

1. `.agents/workflow/session-protocol.md` — always. The loop, stop-and-ask
   triggers, definition of done. It links the other workflow files.
2. `.agents/rules/coding-standards.md` — always when writing code.
3. `.agents/rules/architecture.md` — read before adding a file or a module.
   Hexagonal service: use `.agents/rules/architecture-hexagonal.md` instead
   and delete the other.
<!-- {{IF BACKEND}} -->
4. `.agents/rules/api-design.md` — read before touching an endpoint.
<!-- {{ENDIF}} -->
5. `.agents/rules/error-handling.md` — read before writing anything that can fail.
6. `.agents/rules/testing.md` — read before adding tests or choosing what to run.
7. `.agents/rules/security.md` — read before touching input, files, permissions.
8. `.agents/rules/documentation.md` — read before writing any document.
